CREATE OPERATOR pg_temp.>>>> (PROCEDURE = int4gt, LEFTARG = int, RIGHTARG = int,
                              COMMUTATOR = OPERATOR(public.<<<<));
ERROR:  temporary operators kept in memory and ordinary operators cannot be commutators or negators of each other
